<title>USA: Ethan Allen Q3 shr rises to $0.88 from $0.57.</title>
<headline>Ethan Allen Q3 shr rises to $0.88 from $0.57.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.88		    $0.57</p>
<p> Net		 12,849		   8,348</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  14,631		   14,544</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS Ended March 31</p>
<p> Net shr	   $2.32		    $1.42</p>
<p> Net		 33,859		   20,689</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  14,635		   14,538</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers.)</p>
<p>Note: The company's full name is name is Ethan Allen Interiors Inc.</p>
<p>The company said its net sales for the quarter ended March 31, 1997 was $144.7 million versus $134.6 million for the same quarter the previous year.</p>
